  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING - needs TestFramework.Core 0.7.0; add using TestFramework.Config where a step calls context.Configured<T>, and rebuild, because SetupRun(ConfigInstance) gained caller-info parameters. BREAKING - a custom ConfigShape implements Read(values, identifier) and Values(config, identifier), and CreateAsync always disposes the provider it builds. SetupRun(ConfigInstance) now disposes its provider when the run ends, AddConfigShape refuses a second, different shape for a record, and configuration identifiers match exactly, case included.",
